__pycache__/
# monotonic round-slot high-water marks (a RESERVATION: always ≥ the last round
# signed), written next to the running binary. Safe to delete on a box with a
# correct forward clock — the slot comes from wall clock and the file only
# defends against a backwards step. The dangerous case is the opposite of the
# obvious one: a VM snapshot restore rewinds this file AND the clock together,
# so it silently stops defending anything. See DEPLOY.md §"working directory".
round.hwm
round.hwm.tmp
signer-round.hwm
signer-round.hwm.tmp
